"""Mutants of the Python modules of the investigation view. Justified equivalents (2 of 185, both survive every test by construction):
  - "md: tokens escaped": no token of any closed vocabulary contains a character that md_escape changes (checked: [md_escape(t) != t for all tokens] is empty), so escaping them is a no-op.
  - "cli: bytes": click already writes str output as UTF-8 on a misconfigured (ASCII/C-locale) stream on Linux; passing bytes only matters for newline translation on Windows, which cannot be exercised here."""
